 kit changes - lists the open changes, each with the issues it closes, as kit status draws them

   --json   --jq            prints the same facts as one JSON array, one document per change with
                            its issues under closes

   --all                    every open change (the default); it stands alone
   --mine --others --owner

   <number>…                only the changes numbered so, or that close an issue numbered so, each
                            with or without its #: 7 or #7, since # starts a comment in many shells


 kit changes
